{
  "id": "LEV.14",
  "number": "14",
  "bookId": "LEV",
  "reference": "Lev. 14",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 57,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cleansing From Defiling Skin Diseases",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.14.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.14.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to Moses,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"These are the regulations for any diseased person at the time of their ceremonial cleansing, when they are brought to the priest:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The priest is to go outside the camp and examine them. If they have been healed of their defiling skin disease,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the priest shall order that two live clean birds and some cedar wood, scarlet yarn and hyssop be brought for the person to be cleansed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the priest shall order that one of the birds be killed over fresh water in a clay pot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He is then to take the live bird and dip it, together with the cedar wood, the scarlet yarn and the hyssop, into the blood of the bird that was killed over the fresh water.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seven times he shall sprinkle the one to be cleansed of the defiling disease, and then pronounce them clean. After that, he is to release the live bird in the open fields.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The person to be cleansed must wash their clothes, shave off all their hair and bathe with water; then they will be ceremonially clean. After this they may come into the camp, but they must stay outside their tent for seven days.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the seventh day they must shave off all their hair; they must shave their head, their beard, their eyebrows and the rest of their hair. They must wash their clothes and bathe themselves with water, and they will be clean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"On the eighth day they must bring two male lambs and one ewe lamb a year old, each without defect, along with three-tenths of an ephah",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of the finest flour mixed with olive oil for a grain offering, and one log",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of oil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The priest who pronounces them clean shall present both the one to be cleansed and their offerings before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.14.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.14.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "at the entrance to the tent of meeting.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Then the priest is to take one of the male lambs and offer it as a guilt offering, along with the log of oil; he shall wave them before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.14.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.14.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as a wave offering.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He is to slaughter the lamb in the sanctuary area where the sin offering",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "and the burnt offering are slaughtered. Like the sin offering, the guilt offering belongs to the priest; it is most holy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The priest is to take some of the blood of the guilt offering and put it on the lobe of the right ear of the one to be cleansed, on the thumb of their right hand and on the big toe of their right foot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The priest shall then take some of the log of oil, pour it in the palm of his own left hand,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dip his right forefinger into the oil in his palm, and with his finger sprinkle some of it before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.14.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.14.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "seven times.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The priest is to put some of the oil remaining in his palm on the lobe of the right ear of the one to be cleansed, on the thumb of their right hand and on the big toe of their right foot, on top of the blood of the guilt offering.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The rest of the oil in his palm the priest shall put on the head of the one to be cleansed and make atonement for them before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.14.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.14.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Then the priest is to sacrifice the sin offering and make atonement for the one to be cleansed from their uncleanness. After that, the priest shall slaughter the burnt offering",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and offer it on the altar, together with the grain offering, and make atonement for them, and they will be clean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"If, however, they are poor and cannot afford these, they must take one male lamb as a guilt offering to be waved to make atonement for them, together with a tenth of an ephah",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "of the finest flour mixed with olive oil for a grain offering, a log of oil,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and two doves or two young pigeons, such as they can afford, one for a sin offering and the other for a burnt offering.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"On the eighth day they must bring them for their cleansing to the priest at the entrance to the tent of meeting, before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.14.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.14.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The priest is to take the lamb for the guilt offering, together with the log of oil, and wave them before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.14.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.14.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as a wave offering.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall slaughter the lamb for the guilt offering and take some of its blood and put it on the lobe of the right ear of the one to be cleansed, on the thumb of their right hand and on the big toe of their right foot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The priest is to pour some of the oil into the palm of his own left hand,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and with his right forefinger sprinkle some of the oil from his palm seven times before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.14.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.14.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Some of the oil in his palm he is to put on the same places he put the blood of the guilt offering—on the lobe of the right ear of the one to be cleansed, on the thumb of their right hand and on the big toe of their right foot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The rest of the oil in his palm the priest shall put on the head of the one to be cleansed, to make atonement for them before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.14.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.14.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he shall sacrifice the doves or the young pigeons, such as the person can afford,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "one as a sin offering and the other as a burnt offering, together with the grain offering. In this way the priest will make atonement before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.14.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.14.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "on behalf of the one to be cleansed.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the regulations for anyone who has a defiling skin disease and who cannot afford the regular offerings for their cleansing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cleansing From Defiling Molds",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "LEV.14.33",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "LEV.14.33"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to Moses and Aaron,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"When you enter the land of Canaan, which I am giving you as your possession, and I put a spreading mold in a house in that land,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the owner of the house must go and tell the priest, 'I have seen something that looks like a defiling mold in my house.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The priest is to order the house to be emptied before he goes in to examine the mold, so that nothing in the house will be pronounced unclean. After this the priest is to go in and inspect the house.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He is to examine the mold on the walls, and if it has greenish or reddish depressions that appear to be deeper than the surface of the wall,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the priest shall go out the doorway of the house and close it up for seven days.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the seventh day the priest shall return to inspect the house. If the mold has spread on the walls,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he is to order that the contaminated stones be torn out and thrown into an unclean place outside the town.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He must have all the inside walls of the house scraped and the material that is scraped off dumped into an unclean place outside the town.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then they are to take other stones to replace these and take new clay and plaster the house.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"If the defiling mold reappears in the house after the stones have been torn out and the house scraped and plastered,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the priest is to go and examine it and, if the mold has spread in the house, it is a persistent defiling mold; the house is unclean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It must be torn down—its stones, timbers and all the plaster—and taken out of the town to an unclean place.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Anyone who goes into the house while it is closed up will be unclean till evening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyone who sleeps or eats in the house must wash their clothes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"But if the priest comes to examine it and the mold has not spread after the house has been plastered, he shall pronounce the house clean, because the defiling mold is gone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To purify the house he is to take two birds and some cedar wood, scarlet yarn and hyssop.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall kill one of the birds over fresh water in a clay pot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he is to take the cedar wood, the hyssop, the scarlet yarn and the live bird, dip them into the blood of the dead bird and the fresh water, and sprinkle the house seven times.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall purify the house with the bird's blood, the fresh water, the live bird, the cedar wood, the hyssop and the scarlet yarn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he is to release the live bird in the open fields outside the town. In this way he will make atonement for the house, and it will be clean.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These are the regulations for any defiling skin disease, for a sore,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for defiling molds in fabric or in a house,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and for a swelling, a rash or a shiny spot,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to determine when something is clean or unclean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.57"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "LEV 14:57"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "These are the regulations for defiling skin diseases and defiling molds.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.57"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "LEV.15",
    "number": "15",
    "bookId": "LEV"
  },
